{
    "word": "hobgoblin",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3f718fab-e7d0-31df-bb82-bf59f695648e",
                "word": "hobgoblin",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "dc6b789d-c8b4-459e-b4bf-71151d7fcd9c",
                        "entry_id": "3f718fab-e7d0-31df-bb82-bf59f695648e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hobgoblins"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9fc29a36-dc90-32c8-b62c-a551c05d2573",
                        "entry_id": "3f718fab-e7d0-31df-bb82-bf59f695648e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small, ugly goblin that makes trouble for humans."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f151e4c-e8ff-4dbe-918e-3a3b871d082a",
                                "sense_id": "9fc29a36-dc90-32c8-b62c-a551c05d2573",
                                "text": "A M. Berbiguier lately published an elaborate work, in three huge volumes, in which he demonstrated the existence of hobgoblins, described the proper manner of capturing and securing them, and took credit to himself for his zeal for the benefit of mankind, in allowing no day to pass without imprisoning, with his own hands, at least thirty hobgoblins. A writer of biographical notices of contemporary authors, who believed neither in M. Berbiguier's manner of catching hobgoblins nor in the existence of hobgoblins did not scruple to say that M. Berbiguier was mad, and upon this M. Berbiguier brought his action for libel; but unluckily, together with his action, he brought himself into Court, and established in a very few words the truth of the libel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd95268a-8f14-4b7b-82e8-d42c838434b1",
                                "sense_id": "9fc29a36-dc90-32c8-b62c-a551c05d2573",
                                "text": "The eyes blinked out and he heard a faint grunt, followed by the sounds of the Hobgoblin scrambling further back into the tunnel, away from the faint sunlight and the Ur'hunglav's domain."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91f16176-b7c0-4919-80d5-11797aa89868",
                                "sense_id": "9fc29a36-dc90-32c8-b62c-a551c05d2573",
                                "text": "The monster goes unrecognized because he looks like a harmless, pudgy nobody rather than like a hobgoblin. But he reveals his hobgoblin nature through music."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "edda6ac9-0a10-32f0-827a-884822de1198",
                        "entry_id": "3f718fab-e7d0-31df-bb82-bf59f695648e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A source of dread, fear or apprehension; a bugbear."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "83350f21-262f-4e5e-959c-4ecb1bd29177",
                                "sense_id": "edda6ac9-0a10-32f0-827a-884822de1198",
                                "text": "A foolish consistency is the hobgoblin of little minds, adored by little statesmen and philosophers and divines. With consistency a great soul has simply nothing to do."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8eafb651-5a45-4807-8f13-bc9e94ec57ae",
                                "sense_id": "edda6ac9-0a10-32f0-827a-884822de1198",
                                "text": "Under \"Fallacies of Danger,\" then, is listed the subhead of \"The Hobgoblin Argument, or, No Innovation, in which the hobgoblin in question is anarchy; which tremendous spectre has for its forerunner the monster innovation.\" A hot button like this would presumably elicit a visceral response even from Hamilton whose aversion to the hobgoblin of parliamentary reform was apparently his sole unreasoning reflex."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e582a188-1b53-4258-abce-5c564a16d71d",
                                "sense_id": "edda6ac9-0a10-32f0-827a-884822de1198",
                                "text": "However, the public seems to have been able to retain much of its sense of alarm about internal attacks even when the al-Qaeda hobgoblin doesn't actually carry any out."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea9831a9-83f5-4caa-8f8b-5125d0bfaa41",
                        "source_entry_id": "3f718fab-e7d0-31df-bb82-bf59f695648e",
                        "source_sense_description": "mischievous goblin",
                        "target_lang_word": "lutin",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lutin",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07513a5e-5a7a-39fe-bac8-39fe3b2d8931",
                                        "entry_id": "ddeb8044-e3e7-3ce9-bef7-269ad6e439c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit démon ou esprit follet qui vient la nuit tourmenter les vivants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Fantastique"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c52355e9-6388-46fb-ac94-458a935fd238",
                                                "sense_id": "07513a5e-5a7a-39fe-bac8-39fe3b2d8931",
                                                "text": "Les fusils de chasse remplacent alors les pelles et les râteaux, car au crépuscule, on chasse le lutin qui pullule dans les rebuts comme des lapins dans une garenne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73ea0c44-09b1-4e01-94a8-7454d539963a",
                                                "sense_id": "07513a5e-5a7a-39fe-bac8-39fe3b2d8931",
                                                "text": "Une solive trouée avec une pierre pour pivot ferme la haie d’un champ ; on reconnaît à de certaines marques les échaliers sur lesquels les lutins et les auxcriniers se mettent à cheval la nuit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e89d056-15bc-3e9d-bc6e-4bfe75598e7b",
                                        "entry_id": "ddeb8044-e3e7-3ce9-bef7-269ad6e439c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Enfant espiègle et pétulant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ea8d235-ef64-4368-8ba0-f16f9d4d16e9",
                                                "sense_id": "6e89d056-15bc-3e9d-bc6e-4bfe75598e7b",
                                                "text": "C’est un lutin, un vrai lutin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lutin",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "deac6ee5-c649-334b-bf4f-ea0c61882666",
                                        "entry_id": "e332378c-76fa-3bfd-b7cf-1fd156b56784",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sorte de cahier de pochettes transparentes pour ranger et présenter des documents, de la marque de ce nom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b392231b-e148-45cf-bb86-ff9d64c283a5",
                                                "sense_id": "deac6ee5-c649-334b-bf4f-ea0c61882666",
                                                "text": "Non, il s’agit des porte-vues ou porte-documents dits aussi lutins, composés de pochettes plastiques reliées, avec une couverture plastifiée colorée, bref, ceci: […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8d204ab-8d20-4661-bf52-5160477d2a1b",
                                                "sense_id": "deac6ee5-c649-334b-bf4f-ea0c61882666",
                                                "text": "Savez-vous ce qu'est un lutin, quand il ne s'agit pas d'un farfadet, un troll ou un enfant espiègle ? … il s'agit d'un porte-vues ou album plastifié pour y mettre des documents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lutin",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "970f7541-418c-3627-ac8e-edf51e677c42",
                                        "entry_id": "cbda01e1-bc09-34a4-81f9-938c9661f4ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est éveillé, agaçant, taquin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89f174ca-4214-4ae2-add0-e5197e51e4df",
                                                "sense_id": "970f7541-418c-3627-ac8e-edf51e677c42",
                                                "text": "Cet enfant a un air lutin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8887943-db0e-4bfd-8c34-b0136ea844f6",
                                                "sense_id": "970f7541-418c-3627-ac8e-edf51e677c42",
                                                "text": "Cette fillette est d’humeur lutine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lutin",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc36f7c6-c949-38b8-ade8-1086aa28cbae",
                                        "entry_id": "77e25e78-8ed7-3bbc-ab48-70748f48403c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à Luc-sur-Mer, commune française située dans le département du Calvados, ou à ses habitants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
